<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87494" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προησσάω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προηγορ-ττάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>overpower beforehand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ προηττῆσαν τὰς ψυχάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					2.53.3
				</span></i>
			: but mostly in pf. or plpf.
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be beaten</i> or <i>worsted before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ὅλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.90.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				10.7.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				13.79
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				15.5.2
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
